{
  "total_ms": 53240,
  "total_chars": 220,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "A01",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "孙子下棋，输了就哭，棋盘一推不玩了。",
      "chars": 18,
      "speech_ms": 4040,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 0,
      "end_ms": 4040,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A02",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "这种场面，我劝您别急着哄，也别让着他。",
      "chars": 19,
      "speech_ms": 3630,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 4440,
      "end_ms": 8070,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A03",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "您越让，他越觉得赢是应该的；哪天在外头输给别人，哭得更凶。",
      "chars": 29,
      "speech_ms": 7200,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 8470,
      "end_ms": 15670,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A04",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "我的办法就两步。",
      "chars": 8,
      "speech_ms": 1210,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 16070,
      "end_ms": 17280,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A05",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "第一步，输了先认：难过可以，眼泪也可以流，但棋子得自己收——收棋，就是认账。",
      "chars": 38,
      "speech_ms": 8600,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 17680,
      "end_ms": 26280,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A06",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "第二步，下次开局之前，先把规矩说好：不摔棋子、不许悔棋、赢了不笑话人；做不到，今天这棋就不下了。",
      "chars": 48,
      "speech_ms": 12370,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 26680,
      "end_ms": 39050,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A07",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "话说在前面，是规矩；等输了再讲，是数落，孩子听不进去。",
      "chars": 27,
      "speech_ms": 5940,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 39450,
      "end_ms": 45390,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A08",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "下棋是小事，输得起，才是大事。",
      "chars": 15,
      "speech_ms": 3340,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 45790,
      "end_ms": 49130,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A09",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "孩子将来要面对的输赢，比棋盘大得多。",
      "chars": 18,
      "speech_ms": 3320,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 49530,
      "end_ms": 52850,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    }
  ]
}